# Preserve raw compiler and profiler binaries byte-for-byte despite the
# repository-wide `* text eol=lf` rule.
**/*.bc binary
**/*.mcfb binary
**/*.bin binary
**/*.elf binary
**/*.pdf binary
**/*.csv binary
# Raw generated/compiler/tool evidence may intentionally retain trailing space
# or terminal blank lines. Preserve it exactly and exclude it from patch lint.
**/*.patch -whitespace
**/*_generated_device.cpp -whitespace
**/mx-smi-help.txt -whitespace
**/*.log -whitespace
**/*_environment.txt -whitespace
